## 3. Core Responsibilities

Build a structured property due-diligence and assessment backend.

Support:

1. Pre-purchase property assessments.
2. Pre-sale property assessments.
3. Pre-rental property assessments.
4. Pre-investment property assessments.
5. Technical building inspections.
6. Structural-condition observations.
7. Electrical-system assessment records.
8. Plumbing-system assessment records.
