15. Permit and regulatory-document checklist records.
16. Property-document completeness assessment.
17. Financial-document review references.
18. Location and neighborhood due-diligence references.
19. Environmental and access-related observations.
20. Inspection findings and evidence.
21. Defect severity classification.
22. Remediation recommendations and follow-up status.
